<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 2.x Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="_Toc235450396" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>Scenario 4 — Inline image within correct wrap mode</title>
   <refbody>
      <section id="sec_d389e7">
         <p>Consider a <codeph>&lt;p&gt;</codeph> element where an <codeph>&lt;img&gt;</codeph> element appears inline within the sentence text — for example, to show a button icon as part of an instruction.</p>
         <table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
            <title>Inline image within correct wrap mode</title>
            <tgroup cols="2">
               <colspec colname="c1"/>
               <colspec colname="c2"/>
               <thead>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <b>HTML Input</b>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <b>DITA Output</b>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </thead>
               <tbody>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock id="codeblock_zyv_cj4_lkc">
&lt;p>
  Press the
  &lt;img src="media/ok_btn.png"
    alt="OK button"/>
  button to confirm.
&lt;/p></codeblock>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock id="codeblock_h42_gj4_lkc">
&lt;p>
  Press the
  &lt;image href="media/ok_btn.png" placement="inline">
    &lt;alt>OK button&lt;/alt>
  &lt;/image>
  button to confirm.
&lt;/p></codeblock>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </tbody>
            </tgroup>
         </table>
         <p><b>Result:</b> The converter detects the <codeph>&lt;img&gt;</codeph> element positioned inside a <codeph>&lt;p&gt;</codeph> element alongside text and maps it to <codeph>&lt;image placement="inline"&gt;</codeph> within the surrounding <codeph>&lt;p&gt;</codeph> element. The alt attribute is mapped to the <codeph>&lt;alt&gt;</codeph> element inside <codeph>&lt;image&gt;</codeph>.</p>
      </section>
   </refbody>
</reference>
